{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》中，除了主角們的鬥爭，介入陳展鵬與傅嘉莉婚姻的新生代小花陳楨怡（Celina）亦成為焦點！她飾演的美貌與智慧並重的雜誌社總編輯Mandy，憑藉43吋逆天長腿和九頭身超模比例，加上一身十足「盜墓者羅拉」的型格造型，氣場強大，準備在劇中掀起一場腥風血雨！\n</p>\n<h2>化身總編輯Mandy 貼身小背心造型勁搶鏡</h2>\n<p>在劇中，陳楨怡飾演的Mandy是「破壞」陳展鵬與傅嘉莉婚姻的關鍵人物。為配合角色硬朗、自信的設定，劇組為她準備了多套超型格短打造型。其中一套白色貼身小背心加卡其色短裙的造型，完美突顯其43吋逆天長腿，望落十足「盜墓者羅拉」般有型有款，舉手投足都散發著名模氣場，極為耀眼。她在劇中與陳展鵬「眉來眼去」，充滿女性魅力的演繹入戲十足，讓觀眾對這位「最強小三」的後續發展充滿期待。</p>\n<h2>UCL學霸變身打女 連續4年參演台慶劇</h2>\n<p>現實中的陳楨怡絕對是美貌與智慧並重，她畢業於英國頂尖名校倫敦大學學院（UCL）巴特利特建築環境學院，是名副其實的建築界學霸。身高171cm以上的她，憑藉「九頭身」完美比例及43吋長腿獲封為新一代「索腿天后」。近年她更積極轉型，打破高貴文青形象，苦練功夫並在國際武術賽中奪得劍術與長槍金牌，成功變身「學霸打女」。作為TVB潛力小花，Celina近年發展蒸蒸日上，計埋今年已是連續第四度參演台慶劇，先後演出2023年《新聞女王》、2024年《巾幗梟雄之懸崖》、2025年《巨塔之后》及今年的《玫瑰戰爭》，實力備受肯定。</p>\n<h2>觀眾期待美人計：小三Mandy是真漂亮！</h2>\n<p>對於陳楨怡這次飾演充滿機心的小三角色，觀眾反應相當熱烈，不少網民都大讚她的外型非常適合角色，並對她的演出表示期待。網民紛紛留言：「小三Mandy 是真漂亮」、「呢個小三好有氣場！」、「很期待 Mandy 這麼聰明的女人怎樣巧用美人計」、「佢對腳真係無得輸」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_21245693036af54379a2c48.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_21245693036af54379a2c48.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_17889196906af5437d5e8fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_17889196906af5437d5e8fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_14858312056af54380b3650.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_14858312056af54380b3650.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_17192177136af543849226c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_17192177136af543849226c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_12983670536af543883f355.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_12983670536af543883f355.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36f_3103382106af543c2d878a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36f_3103382106af543c2d878a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36e_12597301576af543c6080e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36e_12597301576af543c6080e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36b_20942747336af543cf5a24b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36b_20942747336af543cf5a24b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_8830154706af543702b785.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_8830154706af543702b785.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_7069648266af54373077a0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_7069648266af54373077a0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_21438090416af543768e96c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_21438090416af543768e96c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_3963693036af543de76dcb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_3963693036af543de76dcb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:03:58.890320+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1121,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:44:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:38:04.626461+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:57:27.686633+00:00","content_hash":"b2595241d1b7e14954c11e38432482b1185ad08f6f3f9484c04a726028eb219c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}